    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262-a1">

                <pb facs="0462" n="402" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg402"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Department of State and Foreign Relations.–Section of Chancelleria.</head>
                <p>Taking into consideration your acknowledged patriotism, ability, acquirements,
                    and other qualities, the President has thought proper to appoint you secretary
                    of state of <pb facs="0463" n="403" xml:id="pg403"/> the department of the
                    treasury and public credit, trusting that you will accept this charge in order
                    to lend in it your important services.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to communicate the same to you, assuring you of my attentive
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty!
                            <placeName>Mexico</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-01-15">January 15, 1868</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matias Romero,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Present.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
